# Apple libraries the anisette container loads. ENFORCED, not recorded:
# anisette/entrypoint.sh checks the fetched bytes against this file and refuses
# to start the server on a mismatch, so editing this file changes what runs.
#
# Recorded 2026-10-07 from
#   https://apps.mzstatic.com/content/android-apple-music-apk/applemusic.apk
#   Content-Length: 142139820
