#   sha256:         9aab4e3bfd44b509dd657b030d46df536c5592512c256fc59012cce47a2e9c9c
#
# The APK itself is not digest-pinned - Apple can replace it at that URL at any
# time, and there is no immutable, versioned URL to pin instead. What is pinned
# is what comes out of it: these two libraries. So a new Apple Music release
# makes the container refuse to start rather than quietly load different code,
# and a person re-records these digests after looking.
# See docs/anisette-provenance.md.

